  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Build an immune risk score from significant immune DEGs, simulate a patient cohort from the DEA and GSEA effect sizes, then inspect Kaplan-Meier, log-rank and Cox PH results while tuning the significance cut-offs and simulation settings, with volcano, GSEA lollipop and precomputed PPI network views alongside. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
